/CBMif0FVX3lxTFBpNGVBLWRVVW1QR19BTlRRNjdET3l1N1lDQ0lKLW5ZREE5UE5tSHF4d3NMaUhnYTRyTFk2Nm1DS2pZYTF2WUlDZzhQVmRDaUV1M1Y2Y05vUFlQSTlZWGJkM3RWLUszMzRqY3BjMVdGTVNFRzdjamZCREFCNlRYUm8?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Tesla-SpaceX 合併：任何交易之前的 3 個問題 [2026]"},{"title":"If You Invest $1,000 in Tesla Today, Here’s What It Could Be Worth by 2030","src":"24/7 Wall St.","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNSmlYSnllYWxDNElPd2VxajFMZjY3TTFFZ3pTcmhsVm5YeEtLa0FjcU5Gc2lSdTh4RUJxYS03N21MdEtlMUE1eVlnR2xGSzlFLVMzSEsteHllOUQxa3RvTzdtbDVMbVF5cEFUZkRyUl9xZUtXTmpHVENQdWNlNTZZY2txWU14RlE5clB4cFdwaHZmWVBWZ1RpaGlpNk1tR0syUmVaY0Q4YTJnWXpabTZiS2tMbXk?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"如果您今天向特斯拉投資 1,000 美元，到 2030 年它的價值如下"},{"title":"Musk’s Favorite Ticker Is Free for Taking in a SpaceX-Tesla Deal","src":"Bloomberg.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNd2Z0YVBmOXRvcU5FM2kyVzduM3VfQW4xLUVQMTAxSU9GVUZxQmhrc3VxaEszajFPalpzV1dLZUNhRERPclZVS05nWHo4bkpoQzdTWWNxT2lET2FzTHdxTFhTOGFzUVFJOWpjU3pad1ZpR2hWUEQzZUdnTzhpLVZ3cFQtdzhKZ3RIT09RWGd0OHR1VGl5SXpnMWlKZTNnejgtZnlRQWZnQXExd0daYXdoZlJISWN3UQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":""},{"title":"Tesla vs. Ford: Which Stock Has an Edge After Q3 Earnings?","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNV01ONGQ5U1prODJlSThna3oybGRDbDBsNG9XTXlBUTVTb3hmM24wWFVXQWNqUTd0QlZCOW1BYjBsangtaFhpeE5iWVNORUs3Q3pfZjhKQWxxWjdqNDRCMy12dWpua05nOTRKOGloN2RYVTh5VDZtQUtJQVkzdjNGYUMtZEhOclhpT1pMem4zVEFfRUtXY1pkOG1FZXpxN1c3NS02Yk81WVdRUFhfdjZyUw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"特斯拉與福特：第三季財報公佈後，哪一檔股票更具優勢？"},{"title":"Musk Says A Tesla-SpaceX Merger Is \"A Good Idea,\" But Admits It Would Require 1.98 Billion \"Yes\" Votes. He Calls It \"Quite A High Hurdle\"","src":"24/7 Wall St.","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"馬斯克表示特斯拉與 SpaceX 的合併是“一個好主意”，但他承認這需要 19.8 億張“贊成”票。他稱這是“相當高的障礙”"}],"themes":[{"name":"併購","count":5},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"自駕/機器人","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"電動車","count":1},{"name":"關稅/貿易","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-01-29","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1318605/000162828026003952/tsla-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are focused on bringing artificial intelligence (\"AI\") into the real world, through products and services like Full Self-Driving (\"FSD\") (Supervised) and Robotaxi, as well as working to develop and commercialize AI robots (\"Bots\") (including Optimus). We intend to leverage our current operations, in which we design, develop, manufacture, sell and lease high-performance fully electric vehicles and energy generation and storage systems that increasingly deliver AI-related and enhanced software and services to our customers, to achieve that objective. We generally sell our products directly to customers, and continue to grow our global retail, service and charging footprint to accelerate the widespread adoption of our products. We emphasize performance, attractive styling and the safety of our users and workforce in the design and manufacture of our products and are continuing to develop","zh":"我們致力於透過全自動駕駛（「FSD」）（監督式）和 Robotaxi 等產品和服務，將人工智慧（「AI」）帶入現實世界，並致力於人工智慧機器人（「Bots」）（包括 Optimus）的開發和商業化。我們打算利用我們目前的業務來實現這一目標，其中我們設計、開發、製造、銷售和租賃高性能全電動汽車以及能源生成和儲存系統，這些系統越來越多地向我們的客戶提供與人工智慧相關的增強軟體和服務。我們通常直接向客戶銷售我們的產品，並繼續擴大我們的全球零售、服務和充電足跡，以加速我們產品的廣泛採用。我們在產品設計和製造過程中強調性能、有吸引力的造型以及使用者和員工的安全，並不斷開發"},{"en":"Our mission is building a world of amazing abundance. We believe that this mission, along with our engineering expertise, advancements in real-world AI, vertically integrated business model, and focus on user experience differentiate us from other companies.","zh":"我們的使命是建立一個極為豐富的世界。我們相信，這項使命以及我們的工程專業知識、現實世界人工智慧的進步、垂直整合的業務模式以及對使用者體驗的關注使我們有別於其他公司。"},{"en":"The automotive segment includes the design, development, manufacturing, sales and leasing of high-performance fully electric vehicles as well as sales of automotive regulatory credits. Additionally, the automotive segment also includes services and other, which includes sales of used vehicles, non-warranty maintenance services and collision, paid Supercharging sessions, automotive insurance business revenue, part sales and retail merchandise sales. The energy generation and storage segment includes sales, leasing, and financing of energy generation and storage products, services related to such products and sales of energy generation incentives.","zh":"汽車部門包括高性能全電動汽車的設計、開發、製造、銷售和租賃以及汽車監管積分的銷售。此外，汽車部門還包括服務及其他，其中包括二手車銷售、非保固維修服務和碰撞、付費超級充電課程、汽車保險業務收入、零件銷售和零售商品銷售。能源生產和儲存部門包括能源生產和儲存產品的銷售、租賃和融資、與此類產品相關的服務以及能源生產激勵措施的銷售。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We currently manufacture five different consumer vehicles – the Model 3, Y, S, X and Cybertruck. Model 3 is a four-door mid-size sedan that we designed for manufacturability with a base price for mass-market appeal. Model Y is a compact sport utility vehicle (\"SUV\") built on the Model 3 platform with seating for up to seven adults. Model S is a four-door full-size sedan and Model X is a mid-size SUV with seating for up to seven adults. Model S and Model X feature the highest performance characteristics and longest ranges that we offer in a sedan and SUV, respectively. The Cybertruck is a full-size electric pickup truck with a stainless steel exterior that has the utility and strength of a truck while featuring the speed of a sports car. In 2022, we also began early production and deliveries of a commercial electric vehicle, the Tesla Semi.","zh":"我們目前生產五種不同的消費車輛——Model 3、Y、S、X 和 Cyber​​truck。 Model 3 是一款四門中型轎車，我們的設計專注於可製造性，並以吸引大眾市場的基本價格為基礎。 Model Y 是一款基於 Model 3 平台打造的緊湊型運動型多用途車 (“SUV”)，最多可容納 7 名成人。 Model S 是一款四門全尺寸轎車，Model X 是一款中型 SUV，最多可容納 7 名成人。 Model S 和 Model X 分別具有我們在轎車和 SUV 中提供的最高性能特徵和最長續航里程。 Cyber​​truck 是一款全尺寸電動皮卡車，採用不銹鋼外觀，具有卡車的實用性和強度，同時又具有跑車的速度。 2022 年，我們也開始了商用電動車 Tesla Semi 的早期生產和交付。"},{"en":"We have planned electric vehicles to address additional vehicle markets, and will continue leveraging developments in our proprietary Full Self-Driving (\"FSD\") (Supervised) features, battery cell and other technologies. For purposes of this filing, use of the term \"FSD (Supervised)\" includes the equivalent naming convention, \"FSD (Capability)\" that is used in the European, Middle East and Asia-Pacific regions. In June 2025, we launched our Robotaxi service, an autonomous ride-hailing platform that harnesses our technology and vehicles. We expect this service will open access to an expanded customer base as modes of transportation evolve, and, along with products such as FSD (Supervised) subscriptions, unlock the potential to advance a service-driven business model based on AI, software and fleet-based profits. Our Robotaxi business currently operates with Model Y vehicles but, in time, w","zh":"我們已計劃透過電動車來滿足其他汽車市場的需求，並將繼續利用我們專有的全自動駕駛（「FSD」）（受監督）功能、電池和其他技術的開發。出於本申請的目的，術語「FSD（受監管）」的使用包括歐洲、中東和亞太地區使用的等效命名約定「FSD（能力）」。 2025 年 6 月，我們推出了 Robotaxi 服務，這是一個利用我們的技術和車輛的自動駕駛叫車平台。我們預計，隨著交通運輸方式的發展，這項服務將能夠接觸到更多的客戶群，並且與 FSD（監督）訂閱等產品一起，釋放出推進基於人工智慧、軟體和基於車隊的利潤的服務驅動型商業模式的潛力。我們的 Robotaxi 業務目前使用 Model Y 車輛運營，但隨著時間的推移，我們將"}],"customers":[{"en":"Historically, we have been able to achieve sales without relying on traditional advertising and at relatively low marketing costs. We continue to monitor our public narrative and brand, and tailor our marketing efforts accordingly, including through investments in customer education and advertising as necessary.","zh":"從歷史上看，我們一直能夠在不依賴傳統廣告且行銷成本相對較低的情況下實現銷售。我們將繼續監控我們的公共敘事和品牌，並相應地調整我們的行銷工作，包括在必要時對客戶教育和廣告進行投資。"},{"en":"Our vehicle sales channels currently include our website and a global network of company-owned stores. In some jurisdictions, we also have galleries to educate and inform customers about our products, but such locations do not transact in the sale of vehicles. We believe this infrastructure enables us to better control costs of inventory, manage warranty service and pricing, educate consumers about electric vehicles, make our vehicles more affordable, maintain and strengthen the Tesla brand and obtain rapid customer feedback.","zh":"我們的汽車銷售管道目前包括我們的網站和公司自營商店的全球網路。在某些司法管轄區，我們還設有畫廊來教育和告知客戶我們的產品，但這些地點不進行車輛銷售交易。我們相信，這項基礎設施使我們能夠更好地控制庫存成本、管理保固服務和定價、教育消費者有關電動車的知識、使我們的車輛更加實惠、維護和加強特斯拉品牌並獲得快速的客戶回饋。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The worldwide automotive market is highly competitive and we expect it will become even more competitive in the future as a significant and growing number of established and new automobile manufacturers, as well as other companies, have entered, or are reported to have plans to enter the electric vehicle market.","zh":"全球汽車市場競爭激烈，我們預計，隨著越來越多的老牌和新汽車製造商以及其他公司已經進入或據報道計劃進入電動車市場，該市場的競爭將變得更加激烈。"},{"en":"We believe that our vehicles compete in the market based on both their traditional segment classification as well as their propulsion technology. For example, Cybertruck competes with other pickup trucks, Model S and Model X compete primarily with premium sedans and premium SUVs and Model 3 and Model Y compete with small to medium-sized sedans and compact SUVs, all of which are extremely competitive markets. Competing products typically include internal combustion vehicles from more established automobile manufacturers; however, many established and new automobile manufacturers have entered or have announced plans to enter the market for electric and other alternative fuel vehicles. Overall, we believe these announcements and vehicle introductions promote the development of the electric vehicle market by highlighting the attractiveness of electric vehicles relative to internal combustion","zh":"我們相信，我們的車輛基於其傳統細分市場分類和推進技術在市場上競爭。例如，Cyber​​truck 與其他皮卡競爭，Model S 和 Model X 主要與高檔轎車和高檔 SUV 競爭，Model 3 和 Model Y 與中小型轎車和緊湊型 SUV 競爭，這些都是競爭極其激烈的市場。競爭產品通常包括來自較成熟的汽車製造商的內燃機車輛；然而，許多老牌和新的汽車製造商已經進入或已經宣布計劃進入電動和其他替代燃料汽車市場。總體而言，我們認為這些公告和車輛介紹凸顯了電動車相對於內燃機汽車的吸引力，從而促進了電動車市場的發展"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Automotive","val":82056000000,"zh":"汽車"},{"name":"Energy Generation & Storage","val":12771000000,"zh":"能源發電與儲存"}],"total":94827000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Sales & Services","val":92614000000,"zh":"銷售與服務"},{"name":"Automotive Revenues","val":69526000000,"zh":"汽車收入"},{"name":"Automotive Sales","val":65821000000,"zh":"汽車銷售"},{"name":"Energy Generation & Storage","val":12771000000,"zh":"能源發電與儲存"},{"name":"Services & Other","val":12530000000,"zh":"服務及其他"},{"name":"Energy Generation & Storage Sales","val":12270000000,"zh":"能源生產和儲存銷售"},{"name":"Automotive Regulatory Credits","val":1993000000,"zh":"汽車碳權"},{"name":"Automotive Leasing","val":1712000000,"zh":"汽車租賃"},{"name":"Energy Generation & Storage Leasing","val":501000000,"zh":"發電和儲存租賃"}],"total":94827000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":47627000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":26238000000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"CN","val":20962000000,"zh":"中國"}],"total":94827000000}},"peers":["AAPL","AMZN","META","GOOG","NVDA"]}}